    "description": "What: CE-6009 (city battle M-1, docs/designs/group-maneuvers/DESIGN_City_Battle_Showcase.md §4, §11 M-1) - a RIFLE PLATOON, the attacker's kit: a body-less platoon (type 305, key @Platoon) commanding three squads (302) of six soldiers (2002; one grenadier 2004): leader, MG, grenadier, three riflemen, abreast 15 m apart round the anchor, idle until ordered. Params: side, name (the platoon's name). Judge: inserted, 1 platoon + 3 squads + 18 men appear round the anchor, of side 'side', each man under his squad, each squad under the platoon.",
